### Create policy version
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/policies?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

{
  "content": {
    "code": "privacy-1-0",
    "type": "POLICY",
    "name": "Privacy policy",
    "title": "Privacy policy",
    "description": "Policy body",
    "slug": "privacy",
    "noIndex": false
  },
  "policyType": "PRIVACY",
  "policyVersion": "1.0",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-08-13",
  "acceptanceRequired": true,
  "jurisdiction": "SA",
  "displayLocations": ["FOOTER", "CHECKOUT"]
}

> {% client.global.set("POLICY_ID", response.body.content.id); client.global.set("POLICY_VERSION", response.body.content.version); %}

### Publish policy version
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/policies/{{POLICY_ID}}/publish?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}
If-Match: {{POLICY_VERSION}}

### Re-publishing an immutable version returns 422
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/policies/{{POLICY_ID}}/publish?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}
If-Match: {{POLICY_VERSION}}

### List policy version history
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/policies?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&type=PRIVACY
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}
